  "goodToKnow": "Verjährt means statute-barred or time-barred: eine verjährte Straftat, eine verjährte Forderung (debt). Verjähren means to become time-barred, and die Verjährung is the statute of limitations. After long debates, the Bundestag decided in 1979 that murder, including Nazi murders, never becomes statute-barred. Ordinary debts typically expire after three years."
